# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day30

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| assess | 평가하다 | Researchers assessed the effects of the treatment. |
| consistent | 일관된 | The results were consistent across the studies. |
| indicate | 나타내다, 보여주다 | The results indicate a significant change. |

---

## Synonyms

### assess
→ evaluate / judge

### consistent
→ stable / uniform

### indicate
→ show / suggest

---

## Useful Collocations

assess the impact
→ 영향을 평가하다

consistent results
→ 일관된 결과

indicate that
→ ~을 나타내다

